flowchart TD
    A[Compile with symbols] -->|gcc -g -O2| B[Binary]
    B -->|perf record ./program| C[perf.data]
    
    C --> D{Analysis Type}
    D -->|perf report| E[Function Hotspots]
    D -->|perf annotate| F[Line-by-line]
    D -->|perf script| G[Raw events]
    D -->|perf flamegraph| H[Flame Graph]
    
    E --> I[Top consuming functions]
    F --> J[Assembly with costs]
    G --> K[FlameGraph.pl]
    K --> H
    
    H --> L[Interactive visualization]
    I --> M[Optimization targets]
    J --> M
    L --> M
    
    N[perf stat] --> N1[Overall statistics]
    N1 --> N2[Cache misses]
    N1 --> N3[Branch predictions]
    N1 --> N4[Instructions per cycle]
    
    style M fill:#e8f5e8
    style C fill:#fff4e1
    style H fill:#e1f5ff
